03:25.720 --> 03:27.125
so the absolute value of that is that,

03:27.125 --> 03:28.588
absolute value of that is that,

03:28.588 --> 03:30.028
absolute value of that is that,

03:30.028 --> 03:35.028
absolute value of negative 220
is going to be positive 220.

03:35.217 --> 03:37.319
So we saw here when time,

03:37.319 --> 03:41.266
when T is equal to 24
V of T is negative 220,

03:41.266 --> 03:42.938
she's running in the opposite direction

03:42.938 --> 03:44.598
or jogging on the other direction,

03:44.598 --> 03:46.885
