use the right boundary

05:04.249 --> 05:05.061
as the height

05:05.061 --> 05:08.881
and so they tell us to
use a right Riemann sum.

05:08.881 --> 05:10.286
A right Riemann sum,

05:10.286 --> 05:12.329
